{"availability":"available","full":"nano-muse/nanoMuse","name":"nanoMuse","description":"nanoMuse: an open-source personal agent for every device you own. One agent with a name and a look of its own that does things, keeps working while the app is closed, remembers you, and asks before anything you cannot undo. On Android, iPhone and iPad, Windows / macOS / Linux and in the browser; your phone's screen and your computer as its hands.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Swift","stars":1342,"forks":149,"created":"2026-09-23T06:13:06Z","updated":"2026-10-16T03:14:20Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nanomuse.cn/","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agent","android","computer-use","cross-device","desktop-app","gui-agent","ios","linux","llm","mcp","meta-muse","mobile-agent","muse","nanomuse","openminis","openmuse","personal-agent"],"demo":"https://demo.nanomuse.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.130Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.130Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.130Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:21.574Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T11:13:36.150Z","stars":137,"forks":17},{"at":"2026-10-08T12:58:59.955Z","stars":321,"forks":31},{"at":"2026-10-09T23:12:06.753Z","stars":518,"forks":49},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:21.574Z","stars":795,"forks":82},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:04.130Z","stars":1342,"forks":149}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["English | 简体中文 | 繁體中文 | Español | Français | Bahasa Indonesia | 日本語 | 한국어 | Русский | Tiếng Việt","nanoMuse is an open-source personal agent for every device you own. One agent with a name and a look of its own, in the style of Meta's Muse: it does things instead of answering questions, keeps working while the app is closed, remembers you, and stops to ask before anything you could not undo.","nano means the whole set, small enough to run and deploy yourself: the phone app, the desktop app, the web console and the relay that joins them are all in this repository, under GPL-3.0-or-later. Free, open source, non-profit. Let's build it together. Sign in and you get a free allowance of model use on the community relay (the developer pays for it); when it is gone, use your own key. The same relay runs on a server of yours, so nothing has to leave your house. Latest: 1.0.2 Trim, release notes · try it in the browser."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nano-muse/nanoMuse/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"26671f13ea377b41e5b30a9c4debe435e1a847e96967d7f8478c3ed3652e6e9c","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:21.698Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:21.698Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"English | 简体中文 | 繁體中文 | Español | Français | Bahasa Indonesia | 日本語 | 한국어 | Русский | Tiếng Việt","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nano-muse/nanoMuse/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in and you get a free allowance of model use on the community relay (the developer pays for it); when it is gone, use your own key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nano-muse/nanoMuse/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Open the app, sign in with an e-mail or a mainland-China phone number, and it has a model to think with.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nano-muse/nanoMuse/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"nanomuse.cn/docs: install per platform, every device, hands, connectors, memory, self-hosting, the protocols.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nano-muse/nanoMuse/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Three ways: no server at all with your own key, your own relay with scripts/self-host.sh, or a runtime of your own for the web app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nano-muse/nanoMuse/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"26671f13ea377b41e5b30a9c4debe435e1a847e96967d7f8478c3ed3652e6e9c","source